{"answer": 3, "html": "\n  <div class=\"sol-step\">\n    <div class=\"sol-h\"><span class=\"sol-num\">1</span> 곱의 미분법을 적용한다</div>\n    $$\n    g'(x)=2xf(x)+x^2f'(x).\n    $$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sol-step\">\n    <div class=\"sol-h\"><span class=\"sol-num\">2</span> \\(x=2\\)를 대입한다</div>\n    $$\n    g'(2)=4f(2)+4f'(2)=4\\times1+4\\times3=16.\n    $$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sol-final\">답 &nbsp;③</div>\n"}